{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1000_p", "source_sha256": "45baae75eba6f0da9a52af2e1d20589b014a2478a17d258e9ff4aa771dafe779", "ja": "（Cleaskyのライブが終わって、数日。以来、\n美也とエレナふたりへのオファーは続いている……）", "zh": "（『Cleasky』的演唱会结束已经过了好几天。\n之后不断有工作邀约找上美也和艾琳娜……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "0bc46ecc2560d7e0196ea2f7b0518f0d6c87b36b19398b8663ccc4a367a00812", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまです～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9164bb7482e5f93dd38c09ec40eb810ad9156b8dbde4dada12b18e43f6117547", "ja": "美也、お疲れ。今から帰りか？", "zh": "美也，你也辛苦了。要回家了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "c5c55a7b802fdf3532ef47574d7a9a42d4f46ef5c169b29240c3c37d757941be", "ja": "はい～。\n{$P$}さんは、まだお仕事ですか～？", "zh": "是的～\n{$P$}先生还在工作吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b217e9bfde9ff24374dc921a2f47c28b5b6e8646ac36c7b77c414f406f9fad5d", "ja": "ああ、Cleaskyのライブが好評だったからな。\nこの後も、打ち合わせなんだ。", "zh": "是啊，因为『Cleasky』的演唱会大受好评。\n接下来我还要去开会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "c148fcbec81b74f218242ce7629a3e87e6a67af855867ec5243fa53fcab9c428", "ja": "お～、そうでしたか～。\nそれは何よりですな～。", "zh": "喔～原来是这样啊～\n那真是太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1006_p", "source_sha256": "10e81c7e1029b3e9ea731dc7513208bda0c6d1fc1326b90d488d571f31c7064f", "ja": "Cleasky……美也とエレナの描いた青春が、\n大勢の心に響いた結果だと思う。よかったな！", "zh": "我认为这是『Cleasky』……美也和艾琳娜描绘的青春，\n引起广大观众反响的结果。真的很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "e2262b364266aba57582abd04462bdd03a185c3d72cf5d9315823a60539117bd", "ja": "そう言われると、なんだか照れますね～。\nでも、頑張ったかいがありましたよ～。", "zh": "被这样称赞，真有点不好意思～\n不过，这表示我们的努力有回报了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "e1d7660941eb0b757aeeb1c7c98667ba12fba72997c944adf2aff1bc7d81ddc6", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、\n今度は私達と一緒に、サッカーをしましょうね～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n下次也来和我们一起踢足球吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "42f0a81bde2b125018c8403a7642bc70f734368f6af0d29f9927eda47bca42de", "ja": "それから、将棋も一緒に指しましょう～。\n囲碁も楽しいですよ～。それから、それから……。", "zh": "然后再一起下将棋吧～\n围棋也很有趣喔～然后、然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1011_p", "source_sha256": "69df4910de26c54b4e51ccc001dea1ecc2ab83ee928c5c949edbcf4940e50d2f", "ja": "？　美也、どうかしたのか。", "zh": "嗯？美也，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "8f11ab32a5b13ec9d28ebcb061b5808f9a4916beb26a9869c8f27a793b1df3a8", "ja": "わかりましたよ～。{$P$}さんは、\n私達の青春なんですね～。", "zh": "我懂了～{$P$}先生，\n你就是我们的青春呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1013_p", "source_sha256": "85dd95a1095a1d4bf0ec6e0a9b32f4a1fec9e72159b1b82bedca8695c1117a1b", "ja": "青春？", "zh": "青春？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "2908377268f580fdae19b6597e39bf6a6d0c06b91e21168b647f1fdff2f55e84", "ja": "はい～。私やエレナさんが、もっと大人になって、\n青春のことを思い出すとき……。", "zh": "是的～等我和艾琳娜长得更大之后，\n回想起青春时光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "143da126b68dc57b1ad4bb307941e808b02c48883480f603ad4beabe7462d2bc", "ja": "{$P$}さんのことも、\nきっと思い出すんじゃないかと思いまして～。", "zh": "我觉得一定也会想到\n{$P$}先生～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "235064bebe22262a3d54bb215ad624fa1651c44590796f9e59fbf2883cae707c", "ja": "だって私達、{$P$}さんと\nずっと一緒にいますからね～。ふふふ。", "zh": "因为我们一直都和\n{$P$}先生待在一起啊～呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d96cab004e8cb2f61d9151608faba466abeaf6b590983a7d226aac6dae7d53bf", "ja": "そうか、それは嬉しいな。\n結構、責任重大な気もするけど……。", "zh": "原来是这样，这还真令人开心呢。\n但也感到身负重任……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "bd1107b1f828bbe4575705d26cda17b7a2f7064c4188d6c0ff347a1d54b83216", "ja": "そうですね～。責任重大です～。", "zh": "对啊～身负重任喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0063_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "1315ebef429f705f16a4ca414b00d182a2001fc48e0294b4056ee2b2ca6bbe25", "ja": "だからこれからも、いっぱい、\n楽しい青春を過ごしましょうね～。むふふ。", "zh": "所以今后也要继续一起度过欢乐的青春时光喔～\n呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
